// a correction goes in that folder's overrides.json (with its reason and source) or roster-changes.json.
//
// ── Who is here ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// 775 legends (413 guards and wings, 362 bigs). A school sits in its 2026-27 conference (data/cbb-teams.js), so the
